From 5e0a5f22245e63de9ff5eaafcec2c34bedc3de69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude-dev-code <279680375+claude-dev-code@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 14:33:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add DataForB2B tool nodes (search & enrich
 people/companies)

Adds six Tool nodes wrapping the DataForB2B API (B2B data: search and
enrich companies and professional profiles), plus the DataForB2B API
credential. The nodes share one core.ts (client + filter schema + tool
classes) and reuse the existing DynamicStructuredTool from OpenAPIToolkit,
following the Jira node pattern.

Nodes (category Tools):
- DataForB2B Search People        POST /search/people
- DataForB2B Search Companies     POST /search/companies
- DataForB2B Reasoning Search     POST /search/reasoning
- DataForB2B Typeahead            GET  /typeahead
- DataForB2B Enrich LinkedIn Profile  POST /enrich/profile
- DataForB2B Enrich Company       POST /enrich/company

Auth is the api_key header via the dataForB2BApi credential
(type: password). Requests use secureFetch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
